#: ../developer/database.md:1
msgid "Database"
msgstr "数据库"

#: ../developer/database.md:3
msgid ""
"The gateway keeps request logs, accounts, API keys, its settings and "
"every runtime admin change in PostgreSQL (asyncpg). This page covers the "
"connection, the schema, what is stored, backups and pgAdmin."
msgstr ""
"网关把请求日志、账号、API key、设置项以及管理员在运行时做的所有改动都保存在 "
"PostgreSQL（asyncpg）中。本页讲数据库连接、schema、存储的内容、备份和 pgAdmin。"

#: ../developer/database.md:7
msgid ""
"A gateway started with `DB_ENABLED=false` still routes requests, but has "
"no request history, accounts, API keys or stored settings, and reads "
"every setting from the environment. How `/health` tells that apart from a"
" database outage is in [Health checks](deployment.md#health-checks)."
msgstr ""
"以 `DB_ENABLED=false` 启动的网关照样路由请求，但没有请求历史、账号、API key "
"和存储的设置项，所有设置项都从环境变量读取。`/health` 怎样区分这种情况与数据库故障，见[健康检查](deployment.md"
"#health-checks)。"

