#: ../developer/database.md:36
msgid ""
"Each gateway process holds at most 18 connections: a general pool of 10, "
"a pool of 4 reserved for the lookups a request makes before it is served "
"(key checks, sessions, quotas), and 4 for alert history. Size "
"`max_connections` for 18 per gateway process, plus your other tools. A "
"request that cannot get a request-pool connection within 3 seconds gets a"
" 503 with `Retry-After`. The pool sizes and timeouts are in "
"`apps/backend/serving/storage/pools.py`."
msgstr ""
"每个网关进程最多持有 18 个连接：一个 10 连接的通用池，一个 4 连接的池专供请求在被服务之前的查询（key 校验、会话、配额），以及 4 "
"个用于告警历史的连接。按每个网关进程 18 个、再加上其他工具的用量来设置 `max_connections`。请求池连接在 3 "
"秒内拿不到的请求会收到带 `Retry-After` 的 503。池大小和超时见 "
"`apps/backend/serving/storage/pools.py`。"

#: ../developer/database.md:43
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The bundled stack runs `postgres:16.16` (`-E UTF8 --locale=C.UTF-8`) and "
"publishes it on `127.0.0.1:${DB_PORT:-5432}` only. Use an SSH tunnel to "
"reach it from another machine rather than widening the binding."
msgstr ""
"自带的服务栈运行 `postgres:16.16`（`-E UTF8 --locale=C.UTF-8`），只发布在 "
"`127.0.0.1:${DB_PORT:-5432}`。从其他机器访问请用 SSH 隧道，不要放宽绑定地址。"

#: ../developer/database.md:47
msgid "How the schema is created"
msgstr "表结构是怎么创建出来的"

#: ../developer/database.md:49
msgid ""
"The migrations in `apps/backend/migrations/` create and change every "
"table. A deploy runs them with the image it is about to start, before it "
"restarts the gateway; [Applying schema migrations](deployment.md"
"#applying-schema-migrations) lists the step for each deployment method."
msgstr ""
"`apps/backend/migrations/` "
"中的迁移创建并修改每一张表。部署在重启网关之前，用即将启动的镜像执行迁移；各种部署方式的具体步骤见[执行 schema "
"迁移](deployment.md#applying-schema-migrations)。"

#: ../developer/database.md:64
msgid ""
"The command uses the gateway's `DB_*` settings and does nothing when "
"`DB_ENABLED` is off. `python -m migrations status` shows the database's "
"revision next to the code's."
msgstr ""
"该命令使用网关的 `DB_*` 设置，`DB_ENABLED` 关闭时什么也不做。`python -m migrations status` "
"会并列显示数据库的修订和代码的修订。"

#: ../developer/database.md:68
msgid ""
"The gateway issues no DDL. At startup it compares the database's revision"
" with its own: with no revision or an older one, it refuses to start and "
"names the command above; with a newer one (after a deploy restored the "
"previous image), it starts with a warning as long as that schema still "
"supports its code. `0001_baseline` brings a database that predates "
"versioning up to the current baseline without preparation."
msgstr ""
"网关不执行任何 "
"DDL。启动时它把数据库记录的修订与自己的修订比较：没有修订或修订更旧，它拒绝启动并给出上面的命令；修订更新（部署恢复了旧镜像之后），只要该 "
"schema 仍支持它的代码，它就带着警告启动。`0001_baseline` 无需任何准备，就能把版本化之前的数据库升到当前基线。"

#: ../developer/database.md:75
msgid ""
"Each statement waits at most 3 seconds for a table lock. A long reader "
"such as a nightly `pg_dump` makes the migration roll back and exit with "
"status 75, listing the sessions holding locks; the running gateway keeps "
"serving, and you can run the command again later. Avoid the backup window"
" for a release that changes the schema. Only one migration runs at a "
"time: a second run waits up to 60 seconds for the first, then fails."
msgstr ""
"每条语句最多等待 3 秒获取表锁。像每晚的 `pg_dump` 这样长时间的读取会让迁移回滚，并以状态码 75 "
"退出，同时列出持有锁的会话；正在运行的网关继续服务，你可以稍后再运行同一条命令。改动 schema "
"的版本要避开备份时段。同一时间只运行一个迁移：第二个运行最多等待第一个 60 秒，然后失败。"

#: ../developer/database.md:82
msgid ""
"To change the schema, add a revision in "
"`apps/backend/migrations/versions/`. A revision must leave the previous "
"release working, because that release keeps serving while it runs and is "
"what a failed deploy restores. Each revision declares `compatibility = "
"\"expand\"` (earlier code still works) or `\"contract\"` (it does not, "
"and it must raise the floor with `raise_compat_floor`). Never edit or "
"revert a revision that has run on a shared database; add a new one. Large"
" indexes on `api_logs` are built in the background instead "
"(`apps/backend/serving/storage/perf_metrics_index.py`), because building "
"them in a migration would block request logging. The design record is "
"`docs/agents/specs/2026-11-02-versioned-schema-migrations-design.zh.md`."
msgstr ""
"修改 schema 时，在 `apps/backend/migrations/versions/` "
"中添加一个修订。修订必须让旧版本继续可用，因为迁移运行期间旧版本仍在服务，部署失败时恢复的也是它。每个修订都声明 `compatibility ="
" \"expand\"`（旧代码仍可用）或 `\"contract\"`（旧代码不再可用，此时必须用 `raise_compat_floor` "
"提高兼容下限）。已在共享数据库上运行过的修订永远不要修改或撤销，改为新增一个修订。`api_logs` "
"上的大索引改在后台创建（`apps/backend/serving/storage/perf_metrics_index.py`），因为在迁移中创建会阻塞请求日志。设计记录见"
" `docs/agents/specs/2026-11-02-versioned-schema-migrations-design.zh.md`。"

