#: ../developer/database.md:115
msgid "Settings and first-run setup"
msgstr "设置项与首次运行设置"

#: ../developer/database.md:117
msgid ""
"`app_config` has one row per stored setting: `key` (the environment-"
"variable name), `value` (as that variable would spell it, such as `true` "
"or `a,b,c`), `secret`, `source` (`admin`, `setup`, `env_import` or "
"`generated`), `updated_at` and `updated_by`. Secrets are stored in "
"plaintext; the admin API never returns them. A row wins over the "
"environment even when empty. See [Settings stored in the "
"database](configuration.md#settings-stored-in-the-database)."
msgstr ""
"`app_config` 每个存储的设置项占一行：`key`（环境变量名）、`value`（按该变量的写法，例如 `true` 或 "
"`a,b,c`）、`secret`、`source`（`admin`、`setup`、`env_import` 或 "
"`generated`）、`updated_at` 和 `updated_by`。密钥以明文存储；管理 API "
"从不返回它们。即使值为空，行也优先于环境变量。见[存储在数据库中的设置项](configuration.md#settings-stored-"
"in-the-database)。"

#: ../developer/database.md:123
msgid ""
"`site_settings` holds the runtime switches and, once the first "
"administrator exists, `setup_completed_at`. While setup is pending, its "
"`setup_code` row holds the one-time code, so read access to the database "
"is enough to create the first administrator."
msgstr ""
"`site_settings` 保存运行时开关；第一个管理员创建后，还保存 `setup_completed_at`。设置尚未完成时，其中的 "
"`setup_code` 行保存一次性设置码，因此能读取数据库就足以创建第一个管理员。"

#: ../developer/database.md:127
msgid ""
"The setup administrator has no `users.email` and signs in with "
"`users.login_name` (unique regardless of case). Accounts created by phone"
" signup have `users.phone` and no email. Service accounts, which an "
"administrator creates for API-key use, have no email and cannot sign in "
"from a browser (`users.is_service_account`)."
msgstr ""
"首次运行设置创建的管理员没有 `users.email`，用 "
"`users.login_name`（不区分大小写地唯一）登录。通过手机号注册的账号有 `users.phone`，没有邮箱。管理员为使用 API"
" key 而创建的服务账号没有邮箱，也不能在浏览器中登录（`users.is_service_account`）。"

#: ../developer/database.md:133
msgid "Request logging and privacy"
msgstr "请求日志与隐私"

#: ../developer/database.md:135
msgid ""
"With `DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT` at its default, `false`, the text is never "
"written: `api_logs.prompt`, `api_logs.response` and "
"`api_logs.request_payload` are `NULL`, and `/v1/responses` state is not "
"stored. Token counts, cost, latency, TTFT, the conversation's shape "
"(`num_turns`, `num_user_turns`, `num_tool_calls`) and a fingerprint of "
"the newest user message (`last_user_msg_chars`, `last_user_msg_entropy`, "
"`last_user_msg_hash`) are recorded either way, for the dashboards."
msgstr ""
"`DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT` 保持默认的 `false` "
"时，文本根本不会写入：`api_logs.prompt`、`api_logs.response` 和 "
"`api_logs.request_payload` 为 `NULL`，也不存储 `/v1/responses` 状态。token "
"数、费用、延迟、TTFT、对话的形态（`num_turns`、`num_user_turns`、`num_tool_calls`）以及最新一条用户消息的指纹（`last_user_msg_chars`、`last_user_msg_entropy`、`last_user_msg_hash`）无论如何都会记录，供仪表盘使用。"

#: ../developer/database.md:143
msgid ""
"Turning it on stores full prompts and responses; weigh that against your "
"users' expectations. Rows stay bounded: a conversation is stored up to 4 "
"Mi characters, the rest of the body shares 64 Ki characters (smallest "
"fields first), and a refused request (a 4xx other than 499) keeps at most"
" 64 Ki characters of each part. `metadata.payload_truncated` marks a row "
"that was cut."
msgstr ""
"开启后会存储完整的提示词和响应；请先考虑用户的预期。行的大小有上限：对话最多存 4 Mi 个字符，请求体的其余字段共享 64 Ki "
"个字符（从最小的字段开始），被拒绝的请求（除 499 外的 4xx）每部分最多保留 64 Ki "
"个字符。`metadata.payload_truncated` 标记被截断过的行。"

#: ../developer/database.md:149
msgid "Which session a request belongs to"
msgstr "请求属于哪个会话"

#: ../developer/database.md:151
msgid ""
"`api_logs.session_id` groups one conversation's requests. The gateway "
"reads the first session id the request carries:"
msgstr "`api_logs.session_id` 把同一个对话的请求归在一起。网关读取请求中携带的第一个会话 id："

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid "Read from"
msgstr "从哪里读取"

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid "Sent by"
msgstr "由谁发送"

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid "`X-Session-ID` header"
msgstr "`X-Session-ID` 头"

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid "Anything using the gateway's own contract; always wins"
msgstr "任何使用网关自身约定的客户端；总是优先"

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid ""
"`session-id` / `thread-id` headers (also spelled `session_id` / "
"`conversation_id`)"
msgstr "`session-id` / `thread-id` 请求头（也写作 `session_id` / `conversation_id`）"

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid "Codex CLI"
msgstr "Codex CLI"

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid "`x-session-affinity` / `x-opencode-session` headers"
msgstr "`x-session-affinity` / `x-opencode-session` 头"

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid "OpenCode and its Kilo Code fork"
msgstr "OpenCode 及其分支 Kilo Code"

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid "`metadata.session_id` or `client_metadata.session_id` in the body"
msgstr "请求体中的 `metadata.session_id` 或 `client_metadata.session_id`"

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid "Clients that label the session in the body; Codex uses `client_metadata`"
msgstr "在请求体中标注会话的客户端；Codex 使用 `client_metadata`"

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid "`x-claude-code-session-id` header"
msgstr "`x-claude-code-session-id` 头"

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid "Claude Code"
msgstr "Claude Code"

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid "`metadata.user_id` in the body"
msgstr "请求体中的 `metadata.user_id`"

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid ""
"Claude Code, as a JSON object with a `session_id` (version 2.1.78 and "
"later) or a `user_<hash>_account_<uuid>_session_<uuid>` string (earlier);"
" `parent_session_id` is ignored"
msgstr ""
"Claude Code，以带 `session_id` 的 JSON 对象（2.1.78 及以后版本）或 "
"`user_<hash>_account_<uuid>_session_<uuid>` 字符串（更早版本）发送；忽略 "
"`parent_session_id`"

#: ../developer/database.md:163
msgid ""
"Kilo Code sends no session id on its newer request path until it takes "
"OpenCode's fix (`sst/opencode#43188`), so those requests have no session."
" `metadata.session_id_source` records which source was used. Session ids "
"are client-supplied labels: nothing is authorized, billed or rate-limited"
" by them, a value over 128 characters or with control characters is "
"dropped, and they are recorded whatever `DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT` says. "
"Recent Requests in the admin console filters by session."
msgstr ""
"Kilo Code 在采纳 OpenCode 的修复（`sst/opencode#43188`）之前，新的请求路径不发送会话 "
"id，因此这些请求没有会话。`metadata.session_id_source` 记录使用了哪个来源。会话 id "
"是客户端提供的标签：授权、计费和限流都不依据它，超过 128 个字符或含控制字符的值会被丢弃，而且无论 "
"`DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT` 如何设置都会记录。管理控制台的 Recent Requests 可以按会话筛选。"

#: ../developer/database.md:171
msgid "Secrets for deleting accounts"
msgstr "删除账号相关的密钥"

#: ../developer/database.md:173
msgid ""
"When an admin permanently deletes a user, the gateway writes a keyed "
"fingerprint of the account to `erasure_fence`, so a request-log write "
"already in flight cannot bring the user's rows back."
msgstr "管理员永久删除用户时，网关会把该账号的带密钥指纹写入 `erasure_fence`，这样已在途中的请求日志写入就无法把该用户的行写回来。"

#: ../developer/database.md:177
msgid ""
"`ERASURE_FENCE_SECRET` is the key. At its first start against a database "
"the gateway records a fingerprint of the key, and from then on it refuses"
" to start if the key differs. Left empty, the fence uses "
"`API_KEY_SECRET`, which the backend generates at that first start unless "
"the environment supplies one. To give the fence its own key, set "
"`ERASURE_FENCE_SECRET` in `.env` before the first start. Neither secret "
"can change afterwards, and Admin refuses both."
msgstr ""
"`ERASURE_FENCE_SECRET` "
"就是这个密钥。网关第一次连上某个数据库启动时，会记录该密钥的指纹，此后密钥不一致就拒绝启动。留空时使用 "
"`API_KEY_SECRET`，除非环境变量提供了它，否则后端在第一次启动时生成。要给它单独的密钥，请在首次启动前在 `.env` 中设置 "
"`ERASURE_FENCE_SECRET`。此后两个密钥都不能更改，Admin 也会拒绝修改。"

#: ../developer/database.md:184
msgid ""
"An `ERASURE_FENCE_SECRET` added to the environment later is not imported,"
" but while it is set the backend uses it and refuses to start, so remove "
"it. After a mismatch (say, a backup restored beside different secrets), "
"restore the original value; never delete fence rows to get past it."
msgstr ""
"之后才加到环境变量中的 `ERASURE_FENCE_SECRET` "
"不会被导入，但只要它还在，后端就会使用它并拒绝启动，所以要删掉它。出现不一致时（例如在密钥不同的环境中恢复了备份），请恢复原来的值；永远不要为了绕过检查而删除"
" fence 行。"

#: ../developer/database.md:189
msgid ""
"Leave `ERASURE_FENCE_PROTOCOL_READY` off until every process that writes "
"`api_logs` runs a version that checks the fence."
msgstr ""
"在所有写 `api_logs` 的进程都运行会检查 fence 的版本之前，保持 `ERASURE_FENCE_PROTOCOL_READY` "
"关闭。"

#: ../developer/database.md:192
msgid "Backup"
msgstr "备份"

#: ../developer/database.md:199
msgid ""
"Without `BACKUP`, the dump goes to `.ops/<distribution>/gateway.dump`, "
"which neither Git nor a Docker build includes. `make restore-check` never"
" touches the deployment's database server: it restores the dump into a "
"throwaway PostgreSQL container of the same image, runs this release's "
"migrations on the copy, and removes it. It adds a second server's CPU and"
" I/O load while it runs, and refuses to start unless the disk where "
"Docker keeps volumes has about twice the database's size plus 1 GiB free."
msgstr ""
"不设置 `BACKUP` 时，转储写到 `.ops/<distribution>/gateway.dump`，Git 和 Docker "
"构建都不会包含它。`make restore-check` 从不触碰部署的数据库服务器：它把转储恢复到一个使用同一镜像的临时 PostgreSQL"
" 容器，在副本上运行本版本的迁移，然后删除容器。运行期间它会额外占用一台数据库服务器的 CPU 和 I/O；Docker "
"存放卷的磁盘上可用空间不足数据库大小的两倍再加 1 GiB 时，它拒绝启动。"

#: ../developer/database.md:207
msgid ""
"By hand, with `pg_dump` in custom format (never add `-t` to `docker "
"exec`: a TTY corrupts the binary stream):"
msgstr "手动操作时使用自定义格式的 `pg_dump`（不要给 `docker exec` 加 `-t`：分配 TTY 会损坏二进制数据流）："

#: ../developer/database.md:215
msgid ""
"To restore over a running database, stop the backend first with `docker "
"stop hybridinference-backend` (`make down` would stop Postgres too):"
msgstr ""
"要恢复到正在运行的数据库，先用 `docker stop hybridinference-backend` 停止后端（`make down` 会连"
" Postgres 一起停掉）："

#: ../developer/database.md:224
msgid ""
"The database holds every setting in plaintext: provider keys, the SMTP "
"password, webhook URLs, and the `JWT_SECRET_KEY` and `API_KEY_SECRET` "
"that sign sessions and protect API keys, as well as user prompts if "
"`DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT` was ever on. Anyone with a dump, a backup, or "
"psql or pgAdmin access can call your providers, decrypt users' stored API"
" keys and sign administrator tokens. Protect them as you would those "
"credentials."
msgstr ""
"数据库以明文保存所有设置项：provider key、SMTP 密码、webhook URL，以及签发会话、保护 API key 的 "
"`JWT_SECRET_KEY` 和 `API_KEY_SECRET`；如果曾经开启过 "
"`DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT`，还有用户的提示词。拿到转储、备份，或者有 psql 或 pgAdmin 访问权限的人，就能调用你的"
" provider、解密用户存储的 API key、签发管理员令牌。请像保护这些凭据一样保护它们。"

#: ../developer/database.md:232
msgid ""
"To delete all data and start over, see [Resetting the "
"stack](deployment.md#resetting-the-stack). The runnable example (`make "
"demo-reset DISTRIBUTION=example`) uses its own volume and cannot delete "
"`hybridinference_postgres_data`."
msgstr ""
"要删除全部数据重新开始，见[重置服务栈](deployment.md#resetting-the-stack)。可运行示例（`make demo-"
"reset DISTRIBUTION=example`）使用自己的卷，不会删除 `hybridinference_postgres_data`。"

#: ../developer/database.md:237
msgid "Inspecting the database"
msgstr "查看数据库"

#: ../developer/database.md:243
msgid ""
"`\\dt` lists the tables and `\\d api_logs` the request log's columns. In "
"`make ps`, Postgres should show `127.0.0.1:...`; anything else means it "
"listens beyond this host."
msgstr ""
"`\\dt` 列出所有表，`\\d api_logs` 列出请求日志的列。在 `make ps` 中，Postgres 应显示 "
"`127.0.0.1:...`；否则说明它在本机之外也在监听。"

#: ../developer/database.md:247
msgid "Optional: pgAdmin"
msgstr "可选：pgAdmin"

#: ../developer/database.md:249
msgid ""
"The Compose file includes pgAdmin in the `admin` profile. Name the "
"profile on every command, including `make down`, or set "
"`COMPOSE_PROFILES=admin` in `.ops.env`: a plain `make up` skips pgAdmin, "
"and a plain `make down` leaves it running."
msgstr ""
"Compose 文件把 pgAdmin 放在 `admin` profile 中。每条命令都要带上这个 profile，包括 `make "
"down`，或者在 `.ops.env` 中设置 `COMPOSE_PROFILES=admin`：不带 profile 的 `make up` "
"会跳过 pgAdmin，不带 profile 的 `make down` 会让它继续运行。"

#: ../developer/database.md:259
msgid ""
"The console serves pgAdmin at `/pgadmin/`. pgAdmin is on its own "
"`pgadmin` network, shared only with the console and the database, so the "
"backend cannot reach it. The Compose file pins `dpage/pgadmin4:9.19`; a "
"volume that ran `dpage/pgadmin4:8` is upgraded on first start and cannot "
"go back."
msgstr ""
"控制台在 `/pgadmin/` 提供 pgAdmin。pgAdmin 位于独立的 `pgadmin` "
"网络中，只与控制台和数据库共享，后端无法访问它。Compose 文件固定使用 `dpage/pgadmin4:9.19`；运行过 "
"`dpage/pgadmin4:8` 的卷会在首次启动时升级，之后无法退回。"

#: ../developer/database.md:264
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "认证"

#: ../developer/database.md:266
msgid "Two checks protect pgAdmin, both on by default:"
msgstr "pgAdmin 有两道检查，默认都开启："

#: ../developer/database.md:268
msgid ""
"The console's route handler "
"(`apps/frontend/src/app/pgadmin/[[...path]]/route.ts`) admits only an "
"admin session, verified by the backend, and refuses on any error. pgAdmin"
" publishes no host port, so this is the only way in."
msgstr ""
"控制台的路由处理器（`apps/frontend/src/app/pgadmin/[[...path]]/route.ts`）只放行经后端验证的管理员会话，出现任何错误都拒绝。pgAdmin"
" 不发布主机端口，所以这是唯一的入口。"

#: ../developer/database.md:271
msgid ""
"pgAdmin's own login, `PGADMIN_EMAIL` and `PGADMIN_PASSWORD`, while "
"`PGADMIN_CONFIG_SERVER_MODE` is `True` (the default). `False` means no "
"login at all. Set the password before pgAdmin first starts: without one "
"it refuses to set up its volume (see `docker logs hybridinference-"
"pgadmin`)."
msgstr ""
"`PGADMIN_CONFIG_SERVER_MODE` 为 `True`（默认）时，pgAdmin 有自己的登录：`PGADMIN_EMAIL`"
" 和 `PGADMIN_PASSWORD`。设为 `False` 则完全没有登录。请在 pgAdmin "
"首次启动前设置密码：没有密码时它拒绝初始化卷（见 `docker logs hybridinference-pgadmin`）。"

#: ../developer/database.md:276
msgid ""
"pgAdmin keeps the login it first started with and ignores later changes. "
"A volume first started without a password signs in as `admin@local.dev` /"
" `admin`: change that password in pgAdmin. A volume first started with "
"server mode off has no login, so after turning server mode on, reset the "
"volume (below). Its master password prompt never appears: Compose pins "
"`PGADMIN_CONFIG_MASTER_PASSWORD_REQUIRED` to `\"False\"`."
msgstr ""
"pgAdmin 沿用首次启动时的登录，之后的修改会被忽略。首次启动时没有密码的卷用 `admin@local.dev` / `admin` "
"登录：请在 pgAdmin "
"中修改这个密码。首次启动时关闭了服务器模式的卷没有登录，开启服务器模式后要重置这个卷（见下文）。主密码提示从不出现：Compose 把 "
"`PGADMIN_CONFIG_MASTER_PASSWORD_REQUIRED` 固定为 `\"False\"`。"

#: ../developer/database.md:283
msgid ""
"For an SSH tunnel, `PGADMIN_PUBLISH=1` publishes pgAdmin on the host's "
"loopback, port `PGADMIN_PORT` (5050 unless set). Pass it on every "
"command, as with the profile. That port skips the console's check and is "
"open to every account on the host, so never combine it with server mode "
"off."
msgstr ""
"使用 SSH 隧道时，`PGADMIN_PUBLISH=1` 会把 pgAdmin 发布到主机回环地址的 `PGADMIN_PORT` "
"端口（未设置时为 5050）。与 profile "
"一样，每条命令都要带上它。这个端口绕过控制台的检查，主机上的每个账号都能访问，所以绝不要与关闭的服务器模式同时使用。"

#: ../developer/database.md:294
msgid ""
"pgAdmin and the agent web app (`/agents`) are served on the console's "
"origin, so a script either app serves runs with the authority of the "
"console session open in that browser. The proxies keep each app's cookies"
" under its own path and refuse cookies named like the console's, which "
"stops an app from replacing the console's session; only a separate origin"
" would remove the shared authority."
msgstr ""
"pgAdmin 和 agent Web "
"应用（`/agents`）都在控制台的源上提供，因此其中任一应用提供的脚本都带有该浏览器中已打开的控制台会话的权限。代理把每个应用的 cookie"
" 限定在各自的路径下，并拒绝与控制台 cookie 同名的 cookie，从而防止应用替换控制台的会话；只有独立的源才能消除这种共享的权限。"

#: ../developer/database.md:301
msgid "Registering the database"
msgstr "注册数据库"

#: ../developer/database.md:303
msgid "`Servers` → right-click → `Register` → `Server`."
msgstr "`Servers` → 右键 → `Register` → `Server`。"

#: ../developer/database.md:304
msgid "**General**: any name."
msgstr "**General**：名字随便起。"

#: ../developer/database.md:305
msgid ""
"**Connection**: host `postgres`, port `5432`, maintenance database "
"`DB_NAME`, username `DB_USER`, password `DB_PASSWORD` (the values inside "
"the container network, not the host port mapping)."
msgstr ""
"**Connection**：主机 `postgres`，端口 `5432`，维护数据库 `DB_NAME`，用户名 `DB_USER`，密码 "
"`DB_PASSWORD`（容器网络内的值，不是主机端口映射）。"

#: ../developer/database.md:309
msgid "Resetting pgAdmin"
msgstr "重置 pgAdmin"

#: ../developer/database.md:311
msgid ""
"Its saved connections live in `hybridinference_pgadmin_data`, an ordinary"
" project volume:"
msgstr "它保存的连接位于 `hybridinference_pgadmin_data`，这是一个普通的项目卷："

#: ../developer/database.md:320
msgid "pgAdmin over mutual TLS"
msgstr "通过双向 TLS 访问 pgAdmin"

#: ../developer/database.md:322
msgid ""
"For a separately hosted pgAdmin behind a gateway that requires client "
"certificates, set these in the console container's runtime environment "
"(the Compose file does not pass them, so add them and the secret mounts "
"in an override; the root `.env` is not enough):"
msgstr ""
"如果 pgAdmin 单独部署在要求客户端证书的网关之后，请在控制台容器的运行时环境中设置以下变量（Compose 文件不会传递它们，所以要在 "
"override 中加上它们和密钥挂载；只写在根目录的 `.env` 中不够）："

#: ../developer/database.md:335
msgid ""
"`PGADMIN_INTERNAL_URL` defaults to `http://pgadmin:80`. With mTLS on, the"
" URL must be HTTPS with a hostname matching the server certificate, and "
"all three files are required; any problem makes `/pgadmin/` answer 502, "
"never a fallback to HTTP. Values other than `true` or `false` fail "
"closed. The files are paths in the container, read for each new request: "
"mount them read-only, readable by uid 1000 (the console does not run as "
"root), for example group 1000 with mode `0440` or a Kubernetes `fsGroup: "
"1000`. Keep all three in one Secret projection so they change together, "
"and coordinate certificate rotation with the gateway. The gateway must "
"enforce mTLS and restrict access to pgAdmin itself; the console's check "
"does not protect a pgAdmin exposed elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"`PGADMIN_INTERNAL_URL` 默认为 `http://pgadmin:80`。开启 mTLS 后，URL 必须是 "
"HTTPS，主机名与服务器证书一致，三个文件缺一不可；任何问题都会让 `/pgadmin/` 返回 502，绝不回退到 HTTP。`true` 和"
" `false` 以外的值一律按失败处理。这些文件是容器内的路径，每个新请求都会重新读取：以只读方式挂载，并让 uid 1000 可读（控制台不以"
" root 运行），例如属组 1000、权限 `0440`，或 Kubernetes 的 `fsGroup: 1000`。把三个文件放在同一个 "
"Secret projection 中，让它们一起更新，并与网关协调证书轮换。网关必须自己强制 mTLS 并限制对 pgAdmin "
"的访问；控制台的检查保护不了在别处暴露的 pgAdmin。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`users`, `projects`, `api_keys`, `account_quotas`,"
#~ " `auth_sessions`, `browser_session*`, `login_events`,"
#~ " `email_verification_tokens`, `password_reset_tokens`, "
#~ "`identity_auth_codes`, `phone_auth_*`, `user_two_factor`,"
#~ " `two_factor_recovery_codes`, `user_identities`, "
#~ "`sso_*`, `organizations`, `org_members`"
#~ msgstr ""

